SUMMARY:Invasive Plant Removal (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Charlotte Wildlife Stewards Chapter and community volunteers to remove invasive species at a Sedgefield area elementary school in Charlotte\, NC. We will remove small non-native trees\, shrubs\, and other plant material in preparation for converting this space into a native plant garden. This project is in collaboration with a Girl Scout Silver Award candidate. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/invasive-plant-removal-charlotte/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1784565568613.jpg
END:VEVENT
