SUMMARY:Native Plant Sale at Wild Birds Unlimited (Chapel Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter for a native plant sale at Wild Birds Unlimited in Chapel Hill. All profits will go toward supplies and native plants for our restoration projects in Orange\, Chatham\, and Alamance counties. \nWe will have Purple Coneflower\, Columbine\, Scutellaria\, Blue Lobelia\, Green and Gold\, Dwarf tickseed\, Golden Groundset\, Brown-Eyed Susan\, Aromatic Aster\, Yarrow\, Virginia Sweetspire\, and St. John’s Wort from our home gardens and Swamp Milkweed\, Orange Coneflower\, Blazing Star\, Wrinkle Leaf Goldenrod\, and Wild Bergamot from Mellow Marsh Farms. Come and stock up for fall planting!
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/native-plant-sale-at-wild-birds-unlimited-chapel-hill/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
