SUMMARY:End of Summer Conservation Happy Hour (Black Mountain)
DESCRIPTION:Come talk shop with the crew from Swannanoa Valley Wild!. Learn more about our past and current initiatives in the Swannanoa Valley region. We’ll be discussing our upcoming ‘All Hands’ Open Invite Board Meeting and the upcoming Wildlife Habitat Steward Training at Highland Farms in Black Mountain. This is a great opportunity to discover ways to get involved in conservation on a grassroots level and make some friends along the way!  \nREGISTER HERE
