SUMMARY:UWS Chartering Ceremony (Albemarle)
DESCRIPTION:The Uwharrie Wildlife Stewards cordially invite you to attend the chartering of one of NCWF’s newest community wildlife chapters. We will celebrate the new chapter with a brief chartering ceremony at 5 PM\, followed by heavy Hors d’oevres\, a guest speaker\, and the raffle of a BRAND NEW Magellan Outdoors Pro 10 ft Sit-On-Top Kayak during this event.  \nOur guest lecturer for the evening is Mr. John Sealy. He is an expert herpetologist who has a special interest in Timber Rattlesnakes (Crotalus horridus).  \nAll proceeds from the raffle go to support wildlife and habitat projects in the Uwharries! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/uws-chartering-ceremony-albemarle/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1784052914013.jpg
END:VEVENT
