SUMMARY:Southeast Bumble Bee Atlas (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Please join NCWF Charlotte Wildlife Stewards Chapter\, NCWF staff\, and Central Carolinas Master Naturalist volunteers to participate in a Xerces Society Bumble Bee Atlas survey. The Atlas is a community science initiative aimed at gathering important data needed to track and conserve bumble bees! We are continuing with our efforts from last year at Clarks Creek Nature Preserve. \nREGISTER HERE
