SUMMARY:Grandfather Mountain Girl Scout Day (Linville)
DESCRIPTION:Join Grandfather Mountain Naturalists and NCWF High Country Wild Wildlings Program as we explore the botanical/pollinator gardens looking for bird food sources. What do birds eat? Many different birds have different diets\, and we can play a role in making sure our birds have a stable food source. Come look for bugs and seeds and take some native seeds home to create your own bird buffet in your backyard! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/grandfather-mountain-girl-scout-day-linville/
CATEGORIES:Featured
