SUMMARY:No Water No Beer (Asheville)
DESCRIPTION:No water\, no beer. It really is that simple. Every pint poured in North Carolina starts with clean\, reliable water\, and the people who make that happen are the water professionals in this room. Join NC One Water at Burial Brewing at Forestry Camp for an evening of craft beer\, good food\, and better conversation. Your ticket includes one drink token and one food token\, and ReWild AVL will be on site\, a chapter of the North Carolina Wildlife Federation working to restore habitat and protect western North Carolina waterways. Bring a colleague\, bring a friend\, and raise a glass to the water that makes it all possible. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/no-water-no-beer-asheville/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
