SUMMARY:Sunset Kayak Tour (Monroe)
DESCRIPTION:Join Union County Wildlife Chapter leaders and Cane Creek Park staff on a kayak tour around Cane Creek Reservoir. Staff will demonstrate how to use the kayaks and equipment at the start of the program and then guide the group as we look for different birds\, mammals\, fish\, and other wildlife on the water. Enjoy the beauty of the outdoors as the sun sets for the day. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/sunset-kayak-tour-monroe/
